{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51988","headline":"学小庾体 · 陈子良","name":"学小庾体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂簟承花落，开帘待燕归。\n（见《四部丛刊》本《後村先生大全集》卷一七七《诗话续集》引唐李康成《玉台後集》）（按：《玉台後集》，天宝间李康成所选，收梁陈至天宝间二百九人诗六百七十首，明中叶後失传。\n刘克庄自郑子敬家得该集，摘其可存者录入《诗话》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}